# Feature constants

Follow `doc/feature-constants.md`.

- Product limits and shared schedule options belong in `src/constants/`, not inline magic numbers in UI/hooks.
- Weekday options → `src/constants/schedule.ts` (consumed by `WeekdayPicker`).
